  "title": "provider tal-token-plan-copy-copy returns 403 for every model in --mode rpc while print mode works",
  "detail": "pi auth check --provider tal-token-plan-copy-copy reports ready; pi -p (print mode) with claude-sonnet-5 succeeds; the same provider/model/flags in --mode rpc consistently fail with stopReason=error and errorMessage 403 Access denied (observed for claude-sonnet-5, claude-haiku-4-5, claude-fable-5). The sibling provider tal-token-plan-06c64a09 (deepseek-v4.1-flash) works in both modes. Scenario evidence runs therefore used 06c64a09; final provider/model baseline is PENDING_OWNER.",
  "reproduce": [
    "pi -p \"Reply with exactly: pong\" --provider tal-token-plan-copy-copy --model claude-sonnet-5   # works",
    "pi --mode rpc --provider tal-token-plan-copy-copy --model claude-sonnet-5  # then prompt -> 403"
  ],
